msgctxt "lista_ainda_nao_baixada"
msgid ""
"The community list\n"
"\n"
"You have not downloaded the list yet.\n"
"\n"
"It is a public text file with what has already worked on other people's\n"
"machines: which Windows components each program needed. Downloading it sends\n"
